Copy this file to `metrics_token` (same directory, no extension) and put the
real METRICS_TOKEN value in it as a single line with no quotes or trailing
newline issues — it's read verbatim and sent as `Authorization: Bearer <contents>`.

The same value must be set as METRICS_TOKEN in Render's environment variables
for the Backend service (see Backend/.env.example). Until both sides are set,
/metrics stays open and this file can stay empty.
